	quest_links: [ ]
	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Terramity 不仅添加了矿石。它还重写了你世界中生成的大量内容，并且有三种结构是通往其三种首领的唯一途径。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>本章是一张地图，而非阶梯。这里没有必须按顺序完成的任务。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#B98A5E to=#EBD1B0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>两个半部分</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#B98A5E to=#EBD1B0 f=0.8>主世界</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的结构，那些你在地表上会绊倒的，还有那些你必须挖掘才能找到的结构。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#B98A5E to=#EBD1B0 f=0.8>下界</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>结构，这三个结构都通向某个不愉快的地方。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>灵魂、仙女和其他杂项都移到了主Terramity章节，因为它们都不是建筑。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Back to the metal ladder\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#8FCB3F\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"2F1A384416C57A23\" } }"
			]
			icon: "terramity:warp_whistle"
			id: "4C1EDFDF328D84F4"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "158302DE2066867E"
