			shape: "star"
			size: 1.5d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B98A5E to=#B98A5E>十七座建筑，大多数都至关重要</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "171E67B6AAA41DC3"
				title: "把地图给我看看"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#B98A5E to=#EBD1B0 f=0.6>Terramity's World</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: -16.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4C1EDFDF328D84F4"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>泰拉米蒂生成的生物大多生活在这里，一部分露出地表，一部分埋藏地下。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>地表上的，靠走路就能找到。地下的，靠挖矿，或者用 </grad><grad from=#B98A5E to=#EBD1B0 f=0.8>虚空玻璃</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>窗作弊就能找到。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: {
